#21200
The Sleeping Giant Inn~
   The room has been set aside as a small reception area where inn guests can
obtain a room for the evening. It is dominated by a large, mahogany desk
behind which lies a keyrack and several wooden compartments. Individual rooms
lie to the north, south, east and west while a staircase in the corner of the
room leads to the dining area below.
