#21208
The Guard Barracks~
   Triple bunks have been neatly arranged around this large room, several
locked trunks sitting at the foot of each bunk. The walls are spartan and
unadorned, and the bunks have been made with such precision that you suspect
you could bounce a gold coin off one. The only visible exit appears to be the
opening to the east.
