#21209
The Northern Gate~
   You stand in awe beneath the immense northern gate of Kir Morthis, also
known as the Holy City. The gate is really divided into two sections: a thick,
iron door to the north and a heavy portcullis to the south. Gazing upwards,
you note an iron grate in the roof while two openings to the west and east
provide access to the guard barracks and a sentry post respectively.
~
