#21218
Twice Sold Tales Bookstore~
   You are standing inside a musty, little bookstore that despite its ratty
appearance and dusty air, is quite charming. Shelf after shelf has been
crammed with a selection of books from tomes of ancient lore to folktales. You
have no doubt that the proprietor of this establishment has some valuable
ancient manuscripts tucked away somewhere, nor do you doubt that you could
discover a real gem buried in the confusion - perhaps even a magickal
spellbook. A small sign hangs above the exit to the north.
~
