#21219
Alchemist's Shop~
   The building serves two purposes: one half of the small store is devoted
to merchandising space and is dominated by colorful potions and elixirs, all
neatly labelled and organised; the other half has been set aside as a work
area with a large counter covered in empty vials, strange reference charts and
all manner of reagents. A sign has been mounted next to the door on the
northern wall.
~
