#21220
The Magick Shop~
   Specialising in magical items, the magick shop contains a small bookshelf
in the corner, covered with different types of spellbooks while another in the
opposite corner is filled with various scrolls. Common reagents sit in jars on
the square counter while all manner of wands and staves hang from the walls. A
sign has been mounted on the wall next to the only exit: a door to the north.
~
