#21221
The Green Wyrm Tavern~
   This is a bright, clean and cheerful little tavern. A long bar of polished
wood dominates the room, but there are also a few wooden tables about the
establishment. The hardwood floor is swept clean, and mugs hang from a number
of hooks above the bar. Decorating the walls are paintings of dragons, both
modern and ancient. A small plaque has been attached to the southern wall
while a staircase in the corner provides access to the upper floors.
~
