The Southern End of Ardyn Park~
   You gaze across the grass-covered Ardyn Park, large trees with leaves of
silver lining the edges. Several benches and tables have been set around the
area to entice the citizens to sit and relax. A bronze statue stands in the
middle of the park, pointing towards the north where the immense northern gate
can be clearly seen.
   The main street through the city travels to the north and south, while
Baugh street begins to the west.
~
