The Sleeping Giant Inn~
   The Sleeping Giant Inn is a haven for adventurers such as yourself; a
place to get a warm meal, strong ale and a comfortable bed for the night. The
lower floor is predominantly a dining area with a bar and several tables. A
staircase towards the rear of the room leads up to the lobby area where you
can rent a cheap room for the night.
