The Blacksmith's Workshop~
   The blacksmith's workshop is almost exactly as you would picture it: a
large furnace burns from within an open pit in the middle of the room; an
anvil sits in one corner and next to it, a large iron bucket full of water.
The floor is littered with chunks of metal and battle-damaged sword blades.
The only exit appears to be to the south, back onto the city's southern road.
