The Kir Morthis Library~
   Known throughout the land as a beacon of learning and knowledge in these
dark times, the library contains hundreds and thousands of books, stacked
neatly on wooden shelves that span each wall. Several desks sit around the
room, local citizens and travellers alike pouring through mystical texts and
reference books.
